out/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# scraped HALCON reference is a local, regenerable cache (MVTec docs/EULA text);
# regenerate with halcon_scrape.py + halcon_coverage.py, do not vendor.
data/*
# ...but the agent-authored HALCON->shape analog mappings are OUR IP (not MVTec
# content, not regenerable) — track them so a fresh checkout keeps its coverage.
!data/auto_specs/
# The Wave-0 north-star pin baseline is a committed test fixture (regenerate with
# recapture_wave0_pins.py --write), not a scrape cache — track it.
!data/wave0_pins.json
# The macro ("DNA") champion registry is OUR IP — the pipelines the evolutionary
# core discovered, condensed into ops. It MUST ship or backends_macro registers
# nothing on a fresh checkout (and tests/test_macro_ops.py fails). Not a scrape cache.
!data/macro_champions.json

